  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The forces acting on the block are shown below.</p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi></math>&nbsp;is normal force&nbsp;and box is falling with acceleration&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/352a477c-26e8-45fc-a0a4-0fb7690de009-image.png\" style=\"width: 130px; height: 141px;\" /></p><p>From figure,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>a</mi></math></p><p>According to question,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
